  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    text: I found this object hidden in the monastery, do you know what it could
      be ?
  - speaker: 1
    text: So he was the one who stole it from me? At the same time, I should have
      expected such pettiness from him...
  - speaker: 1
    text: "It\u2019s a memento of my daughter, a little statuette she made for me
      and her mother; she was so good with her hands..."
  - speaker: 1
    text: "That idiot must have thought it was a religious idol, that\u2019s why
      he confiscated it from me."
